        <mxCell id="2ZoWK9sj4i8Qdd6IFGRA-23" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;When will go for Recruitment?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Capacity Thresholds Exceeded (75–80% Utilization)&lt;br&gt;2. Long-Term Strategic Roadmap Expansion&lt;br&gt;3. Critical Skills &amp;amp; Single-Point-of-Failure Risks&lt;br&gt;4. Proactive Attrition Forecasting&lt;br&gt;5. Workforce Planning &amp;amp; Budget Approval Cycles" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
