        <mxCell id="NohxKwHXf7vvuMiD0lS_-18" value="&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;What was the most energizing piece of work you touched this month? &lt;br&gt;What was the most draining&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,1,1,0&quot;&gt;Are you getting the unblocked support you need from cross-functional leads (PMs/Design/other squads)?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,1,2,0&quot;&gt;&quot;Looking at your current workload, do you feel you are building new muscles, or are you operating on autopilot?&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
