        <mxCell id="1rAg1X7ruvDD9IRL2QiB-8" value="Work closely" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="-1160" width="180" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="w8f9TIITcAE2FDTLvE6E-1" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Phase 1: Strategic Alignment &amp;amp; Governance Framework&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; id=&quot;p-rc_3c60798fce2ef90f-239&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,0&quot;&gt;1. Align the stakeholders for a common goal:&lt;/b&gt; Establish shared business objectives, success metrics, and high-level project vision across all teams&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot; class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; id=&quot;p-rc_3c60798fce2ef90f-240&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;2. Implement DACI before starting RACI:&lt;/b&gt; Define clear decision-making authority (Driver, Approver, Contributors, Informed) to lock in architecture, scope, and trade-offs upfront&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot; class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-730" y="-1070" width="360" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="w8f9TIITcAE2FDTLvE6E-3" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Phase 2: Execution Planning &amp;amp; Task Division&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; id=&quot;p-rc_3c60798fce2ef90f-241&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;3. Implement RACI for individual teams:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; Map out operational roles (Responsible, Accountable, Consulted, Informed) for specific execution ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot; class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;4. Segregate individual tasks:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; Break down project deliverables into distinct, actionable work items and assign them across teams to enable independent work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;5. Enable efficient independent work:&lt;/span&gt; Design decoupled architectures and clear interface contracts so individual teams can build and test without constant dependencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=0" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-740" y="-810" width="360" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="w8f9TIITcAE2FDTLvE6E-4" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Phase 3: Communication, Collaboration &amp;amp; Tracking Setup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; id=&quot;p-rc_3c60798fce2ef90f-242&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,0&quot;&gt;6. Centralize tracking:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; Establish a single source of truth dashboard (e.g., Jira, DORA metrics) to monitor real-time velocity, milestones, and system metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot; class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;7. Call out collaboration requirements early:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Identify cross-team handoffs, joint integration points, and shared resource needs during initial sprint planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=0" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-740" y="-510" width="360" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="w8f9TIITcAE2FDTLvE6E-5" value="&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Phase 4: Risk Management &amp;amp; Escalation Protocols&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;8. Call out cross-team blockers early:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt; Identify and log any external team dependencies or bottlenecks immediately when they arise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; id=&quot;p-rc_3c60798fce2ef90f-243&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,0&quot;&gt;9. Call out delays early to adjust timelines:&lt;/b&gt; Flag schedule variances as soon as they drift beyond baseline limits so stakeholders can adjust release scope or resources&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot; class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;10. Trigger WAR Rooms for SLA breaches:&lt;/b&gt; Automatically escalate any critical blocker that breaches its defined SLA resolution time into a dedicated Focus/WAR Room for immediate multi-team resolution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-720" y="-210" width="320" height="30" as="geometry" />
